  f(f(f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), Y), f(f(f(X, f(Y, Y)), f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), Y)), f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), Y))), f(f(f(f(f(X, f(Y, Y)), f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), Y)), f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), f(f(f(X, f(Y, Y)), f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), Y)), f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), Y)))), f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), f(f(f(X, f(Y, Y)), f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), Y)), f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), Y)))), f(f(f(X, f(Y, Y)), f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), Y)), f(f(f(Y, X), f(X, X)), Y))))
