Lemma 35: f(f(f(f(X, f(f(X, X), f(f(X, X), X))), X), f(f(X, X), f(f(X, X), X))), f(X, f(f(X, X), f(f(X, X), X)))) = f(X, f(f(X, X), f(f(X, X), X))).
